fullDescription.text:
Reports 'if' statements and ternary expressions with 'Comparator.compare()' calls that can be replaced with 'Comparator.max()' or 'Comparator.min()' calls. Example: 'Comparator<String> comp = Comparator.naturalOrder();
String result = comp.compare(a, b) > 0 ? a : b;' After the quick-fix is applied: 'Comparator<String> comp = Comparator.naturalOrder();
