     public MyBean simpleBean() {...}
  }' Inspection ID: UnresolvedMessageChannel

fullDescription.markdown:
エンドポイントメソッドのアノテーション ([@Gateway](https://docs.spring.io/spring-integration/api/org/springframework/integration/annotation/Gateway.html)、[@ServiceActivator](https://docs.spring.io/spring-integration/api/org/springframework/integration/annotation/ServiceActivator.html)、[@Filter](https://docs.spring.io/spring-integration/api/org/springframework/integration/annotation/Filter.html) など) にある不正なチャンネル属性を報告します。

**例:**


      @Component
      public class MyComponent {}
         @Gateway(requestChannel = "requestChannel", replyChannel = "replyChannel")
